      "content": "1<header class=\"header\">\n2    <div class=\"logo\">Jane</div>\n3    <div class=\"nav\">\n4        <a href=\"#projects\">Projects</a>\n5        <a href=\"#contact\">Contact</a>\n6    </div>\n7</header>\n8<main class=\"main\">\n9    <section class=\"hero\" id=\"#hero\">\n10        <img src=\"/images/learn-css/jane-austen.jpg\" alt=\"Profile Picture\" />\n11        <h3>Hi, I'm Jane Austen</h3>\n12        <p>Frontend Developer</p>\n13    </section>\n14    <section class=\"about\" id=\"about\">\n15        <h2>About Me</h2>\n16        <p>\n17            I'm a frontend developer with a passion for creating clean, responsive web experiences. \n18            Currently working at Programiz, I specialize in HTML, CSS, JavaScript, and React. \n19            I also have a strong background in UI/UX design, working with tools like Figma to bring intuitive \n20            and visually appealing interfaces to life.\n21        </p>\n22    </section>\n23  \n24    <section class=\"blogs\" id=\"blogs\">\n25        <h2>Blogs</h2>\n26        <div class=\"card-row\">\n27            <div class=\"card\">\n28                <img src=\"/images/learn-css/flexbox.png\" alt=\"Understanding Flexbox in CSS\" />\n29                <h3>Understanding Flexbox in CSS</h3>\n30                <p>freeCodeCamp</p>\n31                <button>Read</button>\n32            </div>\n33  \n34            <div class=\"card\">\n35                <img src=\"/images/learn-css/responsive-design.png\" alt=\"Mastering Responsive Design\" />\n36                <h3>Mastering Responsive Design</h3>\n37                <p>Medium</p>\n38                <button>Read</button>\n39            </div>\n40  \n41            <div class=\"card\">\n42                <img src=\"/images/learn-css/advanced-grid.png\" alt=\"Advanced CSS Grid Techniques\" />\n43                <h3>Advanced CSS Grid Techniques</h3>\n44                <p>Programiz Blogs</p>\n45                <button>Read</button>\n46            </div>\n47        </div>\n48    </section>\n49  \n50    <section class=\"projects\" id=\"projects\">\n51        <h2> Projects </h2>\n52            <div class=\"projects-grid\">\n53            <div class=\" primary-card projects-card\">\n54                <img src=\"/images/learn-css/shopease.png\" alt=\"Project Image\">\n55                <h3>ShopEase</h3>\n56                <p>ShopEase is a fully responsive and interactive e-commerce platform that offers a seamless\n57                    shopping experience. It features product listings, shopping cart functionality, secure checkout,\n58                    product filtering, and user reviews. With an integrated payment gateway, it provides users with\n59                    a secure and efficient way to shop online. Built using modern web technologies and best\n60                    practices.</p>\n61                <div class=\"tech-tag-list\">\n62                    <div>HTML</div>\n63                    <div>CSS</div>\n64                    <div>JavaScript</div>\n65                    <div>API Integration</div>\n66                    <div>Payment Gateway</div>\n67                </div>\n68                <a href=\"#\">Visit Site</a>\n69            </div>\n70            <div class=\"projects-card\">\n71                <img src=\"/images/learn-css/smoothie.png\" alt=\"Project Image\">\n72                <h3>Smoothie Hub</h3>\n73                <p>A vibrant website featuring a collection of smoothie recipes for health-conscious individuals.</p>\n74                <a href=\"#\">Visit Site</a>\n75            </div>\n76            <div class=\"projects-card\">\n77                <img src=\"/images/learn-css/bakery.png\" alt=\"Project Image\">\n78                <h3>BakeItEasy</h3>\n79                <p>A baking recipe website that showcases step-by-step guides for home bakers.</p>\n80                <a href=\"#\">Visit Site</a>\n81            </div>\n82            <div class=\"projects-card\">\n83                <img src=\"/images/learn-css/meal.png\" alt=\"Project Image\">\n84                <h3>QuickFit Meals</h3>\n85                <p>An easy-to-use site that provides quick and healthy meal ideas for people on the go.</p>\n86                <a href=\"#\">Visit Site</a>\n87            </div>\n88            <div class=\"projects-card\">\n89                <img src=\"/images/learn-css/travel.png\" alt=\"Project Image\">\n90                <h3>TravelShots</h3>\n91                <p>A photography portfolio that highlights unique travel destinations through stunning images.</p>\n92                <a href=\"#\">Visit Site</a>\n93            </div>\n94        </div>\n95    </section>\n96    <section class=\"contact\" id=\"contact\">\n97        <div class=\"contact-form-container\">\n98            <h2>Contact Me</h2>\n99            <form class=\"contact-form\">\n100                <div class=\"form-row\">\n101                <div class=\"form-group\">\n102                    <label for=\"name\">Name</label>\n103                    <input\n104                        type=\"text\"\n105                        id=\"name\"\n106                        name=\"name\"\n107                        placeholder=\"Your Name\"\n108                        />\n109                </div>\n110        \n111                <div class=\"form-group\">\n112                    <label for=\"email\">Email</label>\n113                    <input\n114                        type=\"email\"\n115                        id=\"email\"\n116                        name=\"email\"\n117                        placeholder=\"your@email.com\"\n118                        />\n119                </div>\n120                </div>\n121        \n122                <div class=\"form-group\">\n123                    <label for=\"reason\">Contact Reason</label>\n124                    <select id=\"reason\" name=\"reason\">\n125                        <option value=\"work\">Networking</option>\n126                        <option value=\"work\">Freelance</option>\n127                        <option value=\"work\">Collaboration</option>\n128                        <option value=\"support\">Mentorship</option>\n129                        <option value=\"feedback\">Feedback</option>\n130                    </select>\n131                </div>\n132        \n133                <div class=\"form-group\">\n134                    <label for=\"message\">Message</label>\n135                    <textarea\n136                        id=\"message\"\n137                        name=\"message\"\n138                        rows=\"4\"\n139                        placeholder=\"Enter your message here.\"\n140                        style=\"height: 100px\"\n141                        ></textarea>\n142                </div>\n143        \n144                <button type=\"submit\" class=\"submit-btn\">Submit</button>\n145            </form>\n146        </div>\n147    </section>\n148</main>\n149<footer class=\"footer\">\n150    <p class=\"footer-text\">Made with <span class=\"heart\">❤️</span> by Jane</p>\n151    <div class=\"footer-logos\">\n152        <a href=\"https://github.com\" target=\"_blank\">\n153            <img src=\"/images/learn-css/github-logo.png\" alt=\"GitHub\" />\n154        </a>\n155        <a href=\"https://linkedin.com\" target=\"_blank\">\n156            <img src=\"/images/learn-css/linkedin-logo.png\" alt=\"LinkedIn\" />\n157        </a>\n158        <a href=\"mailto:example@gmail.com\">\n159            <img src=\"/images/learn-css/gmail-logo.png\" alt=\"Gmail\" />\n160        </a>\n161    </div>\n162</footer>"
